<title>USA: U.S. Boxed Beef cut-out at 1500 CST - USDA.</title>
<headline>U.S. Boxed Beef cut-out at 1500 CST - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Boxed beef prices were generally weak on fairly good demand and moderate to heavy offerings. Choice chuck and loin cuts generally steady, while round cuts weak and rib cuts lower. Select rib and chuck cuts steady to weak, while round and loin cuts  weak. Beef trimmings weak on light to moderate demand and offerings. - USDA</p>
<p> 317 Fab Lds  CH 1-3	CH 1-3	SE 1-3	SE 1-3</p>
